  message: "CLOSED on the item's own close condition; nothing was built for it in PR #2354 (the owner's request of 2026-11-23 listed this item among thirteen \"minus any already done\": it was already done). I close it as done on that request and on the record below; reopening is the owner's word, as closing was.\nCLOSE CONDITION, re-read on dev 39bef1108, 2026-11-24:\n(a) \"the shadow log exists and a real run has written a row\": ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/run_records.jsonl holds 5,129 run rows; scripts/coverage-select statement-bar reads 2,841 that hold the selector's answer.\n(b) \"each arm has a test with a mutation control\": 65 mutations, 65 red, on 2026-11-22 (note of that day); NOT re-run today, and the selector's code did not change in PR #2354.\n(c) \"an unlisted kind of changed file is reported, not skipped\": the three newest rows with an answer (2026-11-24) each carry files_not_judged, listing .ci/affected-tests.txt, CHANGELOG.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and the ADR files of the change.\nTHE BAR READS MISSED TODAY, AND WHY. scripts/coverage-select statement-bar on dev 39bef1108 exits 1: RUNS WITH A FAILED TEST LEFT OUT 1, verdict MISSED (v19_11232026/dibin/bar_on_dev.txt). It exited 0 with verdict MET six hours earlier (dibin/bar.txt). The one run is a pre-PR step of 2026-11-24T04:33Z that ran out of space in /tmp (2 failed and 14,853 errors, OSError 28); the same files at the same commit passed alone 15 minutes later (23,369 passed). The bar cannot tell such a run from a selection miss: filed as WI-dakog-punuz-mizik-tarif-somir-vabid-liham-zovig. The bar is not part of this item's close condition; the selector is live under WI-pugol.\nThe title's \"in shadow\" describes the item as filed: the selector has been live since 2026-11-18."  # 0f2a
